/****** UP-List.mcc/UPM_List_GetRow ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPM_List_GetRow -- method of UP-List.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       Method: read one row back for tools that drive the window from outside. The caller fills row and text capacity; the method returns TRUE when the row exists, with the cell texts joined by two spaces, the row box in window coordinates and the selected flag.
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPM_List_GetRow - method id. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Send with DoMethod; see FUNCTION for the return value.
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-List.mcc
*
******/

